cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use TaiwanBioTopoMaps in research, please cite the version used and
  separately acknowledge the boundary and elevation data sources.
type: software
title: "TaiwanBioTopoMaps: Browser-based Mapping of Biological Occurrence Records across Taiwan and Its Offshore Islands"
version: 3.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Hsiao
    given-names: Yu-Chun
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0006-1635-119X
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/YCHsiao-TW/TaiwanBioTopoMaps
url: https://taiwan-biotopo-yc-1019.yuchunhsiao1001.chatgpt.site
abstract: >-
  A browser application for terrain-based mapping of biological occurrence
  records across Taiwan and its offshore islands, with local CSV processing,
  taxon filtering, co-occurrence pies, stable site identifiers, configurable
  map and legend layouts, complete project files, and batch map export.
keywords:
  - Taiwan
  - biodiversity
  - occurrence records
  - topographic mapping
  - JavaScript
  - web application
